# Before: interval bounds were exposed, but an N+ callable prefix lacked type evidence.
# forall f fn(k N+: k <= 2) R, a closed_range(1, 2):
#     f(a) = f(a)
# Now: positive integer literal lower bounds publish the N+ integer carrier.
# Gate: target/release/litex -strict -f examples/infer/atomic/positive_integer_interval_carrier.lit
forall f fn(k N+: k <= 2) R, a closed_range(1, 2):
    f(a) = f(a)
